0
00:00:07,746 --> 00:00:10,482
PREVIOUSLY
ON "AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL,"

1
00:00:10,482 --> 00:00:12,651
WHEN THE GIRLS HIT THE CATWALK
WITH MISS J...

2
00:00:12,651 --> 00:00:15,020
ATTITUDE,
STRONG, STRONG, STRONG.

3
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:17,189
KARI AND DANIELLE
NEARLY HIT THE GROUND.

4
00:00:17,189 --> 00:00:18,857
♪♪♪

5
00:00:18,857 --> 00:00:21,426
THE RUNWAY CHALLENGE
HAD SOME UNUSUAL ACCESSORIES...

6
00:00:21,426 --> 00:00:22,728
(screams)

7
00:00:22,728 --> 00:00:24,596
OH, DON'T DO THIS!

8
00:00:24,596 --> 00:00:26,565
AND JADE
PLAYED ON GINA'S INSECURITIES

9
00:00:26,565 --> 00:00:27,699
ONCE AGAIN.

10
00:00:27,699 --> 00:00:28,767
KISS IT, KISS IT.

11
00:00:28,767 --> 00:00:30,802
WHEN IT WAS TIME
TO FALL ON CUE,

12
00:00:30,802 --> 00:00:33,038
DANIELLE EXCELLED
WHILE GINA FELL FLAT.

13
00:00:33,038 --> 00:00:34,372
OKAY, THAT ONE YOU JUST FELL.

14
00:00:34,372 --> 00:00:36,575
BUT KARI LOST HER BALANCE
AND HER CONFIDENCE

15
00:00:36,575 --> 00:00:40,178
IN FRONT OF THE JUDGES,
AND SHE WAS SENT HOME.

16
00:00:40,178 --> 00:00:41,546
TEN GIRLS REMAIN.

17
00:00:41,546 --> 00:00:44,182
WHO WILL BE ELIMINATED TONIGHT?

18
00:00:44,182 --> 00:00:47,986
♪♪♪

19
00:01:27,425 --> 00:01:31,263
♪♪♪

20
00:01:31,263 --> 00:01:32,931
IT JUST FEELS LIKE SOMEBODY,
LIKE, DIED.

21
00:01:32,931 --> 00:01:34,866
IT'S SO WEIRD,
LIKE, KARI'S GONE.

22
00:01:34,866 --> 00:01:36,868
THAT IS SO SAD.

23
00:01:36,868 --> 00:01:38,303
DURING THE LAST ELIMINATION,

24
00:01:38,303 --> 00:01:41,072
I'M ONE OF THE BOTTOM TWO,
IT'S ME AND KARI,

25
00:01:41,072 --> 00:01:44,776
AND WHEN TYRA FLIPS OVER
MY PICTURE...

26
00:01:44,776 --> 00:01:45,811
GINA.

27
00:01:45,811 --> 00:01:47,345
I'M IN UTTER SHOCK.

28
00:01:47,345 --> 00:01:51,917
♪♪♪

29
00:01:51,917 --> 00:01:55,020
I KNOW I CAN ROCK THIS,
BUT WITH WHAT'S GOING AROUND

30
00:01:55,020 --> 00:01:57,289
THE HOUSE, WITH--
ESPECIALLY WITH ME AND JADE...

31
00:01:57,289 --> 00:01:58,723
I DON'T MEAN
TO GIVE YOU CRAP,

32
00:01:58,723 --> 00:02:01,459
BUT SERIOUSLY, LIKE, YOU, LIKE,
TO BE IN THIS COMPETITION, YO,

33
00:02:01,459 --> 00:02:04,062
YOU GOTTA KNOW WHO YOU ARE,
PERIOD.

34
00:02:05,864 --> 00:02:08,867
JADE IS MEAN,
AND SHE'S, LIKE, MEAN TO ME.

35
00:02:08,867 --> 00:02:09,935
KISS IT, KISS IT.

36
00:02:09,935 --> 00:02:11,503
JADE. NO, IT'S OKAY.

37
00:02:11,503 --> 00:02:13,538
I HATE TO ADMIT IT,
BUT, YOU KNOW,

38
00:02:13,538 --> 00:02:15,040
IT'S REALLY GETTING TO ME,
AND IT'S HINDERING

39
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:16,074
MY PERFORMANCE.

40
00:02:16,074 --> 00:02:17,375
I KNOW I'VE HAD BAD PICTURES,

41
00:02:17,375 --> 00:02:19,344
LIKE, I'M NOT SAYING
THAT MY PICTURES ARE THE BEST.

42
00:02:19,344 --> 00:02:20,512
I HAVEN'T HAD GOOD PICTURES.

43
00:02:20,512 --> 00:02:21,913
I DON'T LIKE ANY OF MY PICTURES.

44
00:02:21,913 --> 00:02:25,183
I PUT SO MUCH PRESSURE ON MYSELF
BECAUSE THEY'RE JUDGING ME,

45
00:02:25,183 --> 00:02:27,085
AND EVERY LITTLE THING I CAN DO,

46
00:02:27,085 --> 00:02:29,454
