48
00:02:33,558 --> 00:02:35,493
OKAY, I JUST WANT TO SAY
I LOVE YOU.

49
00:02:35,493 --> 00:02:37,462
MY BOYFRIEND,
HE'S JUST MISSING ME,

50
00:02:37,462 --> 00:02:40,131
