WE'VE BEEN AWAY FROM EACH OTHER.

51
00:02:40,131 --> 00:02:42,934
WE'RE HERE WAITING IN LINE
TO SEND HER OFF TO CALIFORNIA.

52
00:02:42,934 --> 00:02:45,871
UM, UM, I WANNA MAKE SURE
THAT Y'ALL TAKE CARE OF MY BABY.

53
00:02:52,711 --> 00:02:56,281
I DO GET ANNOYED WITH JOHN,
AND MY GUT IS TELLING ME THAT

54
00:02:56,281 --> 00:02:58,617
HE MIGHT BE A LITTLE
TOO CONTROLLING.

55
00:02:58,617 --> 00:03:00,051
OKAY, BABY, GO TO SLEEP.

56
00:03:00,051 --> 00:03:01,353
I LOVE YOU.

57
00:03:01,353 --> 00:03:03,622
OOH, MY TOE IS SWOLLEN.

58
00:03:03,622 --> 00:03:05,423
LOOK AT MY PINKIE TOE.

59
00:03:05,423 --> 00:03:07,659
LAST ELIMINATION,
I WAS IN, UH, LIKE,

60
00:03:07,659 --> 00:03:10,028
10-INCH HEELS, AND I TRIPPED.

61
00:03:11,329 --> 00:03:12,664
CAREFUL.

62
00:03:12,664 --> 00:03:14,766
DOING OKAY?

63
00:03:14,766 --> 00:03:16,902
I'M ON "AMERICA'S
NEXT TOP MODEL" WITH CRUTCHES!

64
00:03:16,902 --> 00:03:18,203
BUT YOUR ANKLE'S OKAY?

65
00:03:18,203 --> 00:03:20,205
YEAH, MY ANKLE...
I MEAN, IT HURT WHEN I FELL,

66
00:03:20,205 --> 00:03:21,573
