RIGHT NOW.

67
00:03:21,573 --> 00:03:22,707
IT'S MY TOE.

68
00:03:22,707 --> 00:03:24,643
I HAVE A REALLY, REALLY
HIGH TOLERANCE FOR PAIN.

69
00:03:24,643 --> 00:03:27,178
I THINK IT WILL FEEL
A LOT BETTER TOMORROW.

70
00:03:28,346 --> 00:03:29,814
