- I KNOW, I KNOW.

74
00:03:36,621 --> 00:03:38,356
(laughing)

75
00:03:39,791 --> 00:03:42,994
♪♪♪

76
00:03:50,302 --> 00:03:52,137
WE WALK INTO THIS BALLROOM...

77
00:03:52,137 --> 00:03:53,538
