86
00:04:09,487 --> 00:04:12,857
WELCOME TO JANICE DICKINSON'S
POSING CLASS,

87
00:04:12,857 --> 00:04:16,061
WHERE I WILL BE TEACHING YOU
THE FINE ART OF COMMERCIAL

88
00:04:16,061 --> 00:04:18,596
VERSUS EDITORIAL POSES.

89
00:04:18,596 --> 00:04:20,699
WITH ME TODAY IS MISS LISA.

90
00:04:20,699 --> 00:04:21,866
HI, GIRLS.

91
00:04:21,866 --> 00:04:23,001
