95
00:04:29,674 --> 00:04:31,643
THAT LOOKS GOOD.

96
00:04:31,643 --> 00:04:34,646
THE KEY ELEMENTS
FOR EDITORIAL POSING

97
00:04:34,646 --> 00:04:38,717
IS LONG, LUSCIOUS, LOVELY.

98
00:04:38,717 --> 00:04:39,718
COMMERCIAL--

99
00:04:39,718 --> 00:04:42,687
HAPPY, PERKY, SKIPPY.

100
00:04:42,687 --> 00:04:44,089
I DON'T KNOW HOW TO POSE.

101
00:04:44,089 --> 00:04:46,624
SHE IS EXPLAINING IT TO ME,
BUT I'M STILL HAVING DIFFICULTY

102
00:04:46,624 --> 00:04:48,827
UNDERSTANDING WHAT
SHE'S MEANING BY IT.

103
00:04:48,827 --> 00:04:50,862
WE'RE GONNA WATCH LISA COPY
WHAT I'M SAYING

104
00:04:50,862 --> 00:04:52,130
AS I'M DIRECTING.

105
00:04:52,130 --> 00:04:55,166
COMMERCIAL MODELING POSES
BEGIN WITH YOUR BASIC

106
00:04:55,166 --> 00:04:56,568
NUMBER ONE POSE, WHICH IS...

107
00:04:56,568 --> 00:04:57,936
STAND ON TWO FEET,

108
00:04:57,936 --> 00:04:59,904
HANDS DOWN,
WAD.

109
00:04:59,904 --> 00:05:01,239
THIS IS WADDING.

110
00:05:01,239 --> 00:05:02,941
WINDING A WRISTWATCH,
LOOKING UP...

111
00:05:02,941 --> 00:05:05,210
THESE ARE, LIKE, TECHNIQUES
THAT YOU CAN MAYBE, LIKE,

112
00:05:05,210 --> 00:05:07,512
CHECKING A BROKEN NAIL
AND LOOKING FOR A TAXI

113
00:05:07,512 --> 00:05:08,580
AND SMILING.

114
00:05:08,580 --> 00:05:09,781
HA HA HA HA HA HA!

115
00:05:09,781 --> 00:05:11,783
IT'S SO FUNNY TO GET A TAXI.

116
00:05:11,783 --> 00:05:13,785
BUT ALWAYS
IN COMMERCIAL MODELING,

117
00:05:13,785 --> 00:05:16,287
IT'S REALLY IMPORTANT
TO KEEP THE ENERGY GOING

118
00:05:16,287 --> 00:05:18,123
AND THE "HA HA HA HA HA!"

119
00:05:18,123 --> 00:05:19,891
THE ALLIGATOR--
HA HA HA HA!

120
00:05:19,891 --> 00:05:20,959
HA HA HA HA HA!

121
00:05:20,959 --> 00:05:22,127
HA HA HA HA!

122
00:05:22,127 --> 00:05:23,661
HI, IS THIS ALL ABOUT
COMMERCIAL LOOKS TODAY?

123
00:05:23,661 --> 00:05:24,729
NO.

124
00:05:24,729 --> 00:05:26,064
SO NOW WE'RE GONNA
GO INTO EDITORIAL.

125
00:05:26,064 --> 00:05:28,099
IT'S ALL ABOUT...

126
00:05:28,099 --> 00:05:29,134
THAT'S GOOD, THAT'S GOOD.

127
00:05:29,134 --> 00:05:32,103
EDITORIAL MODELING IS MORE...

128
00:05:32,103 --> 00:05:33,505
