129
00:05:33,505 --> 00:05:36,074
(normal voice) EDITORIAL POSING
IS JUST ABOUT WEARING A FEELING.

130
00:05:36,074 --> 00:05:37,575
IT'S THE FEELING THAT
THE CLIENT GIVES YOU,

131
00:05:37,575 --> 00:05:40,178
THE PHOTOGRAPHER GIVES YOU,
THE EDITOR GIVES YOU THAT DAY.

132
00:05:40,178 --> 00:05:41,346
YOU HAVE TO FIND THE LIGHT,

133
00:05:41,346 --> 00:05:43,181
WHICH IS WHY I'M CRANING
LIKE THIS.

134
00:05:43,181 --> 00:05:44,449
CRANING FOR THE LIGHT,

135
00:05:44,449 --> 00:05:46,051
ME ALWAYS BEING MORE FABULOUS
THAN ANYONE ELSE.

136
00:05:46,051 --> 00:05:47,085
(laughing) SORRY.

137
00:05:47,085 --> 00:05:48,586
SO WHEN WE'RE WORKING
OUR POSES,

138
00:05:48,586 --> 00:05:51,122
HOW LONG DO YOU SUGGEST THAT
WE STAY IN IT AND JUST GIVE

139
00:05:51,122 --> 00:05:52,424
DIFFERENT EXPRESSIONS?

140
00:05:52,424 --> 00:05:54,292
I CAN'T GIVE YOU
AN EXACT AMOUNT.

141
00:05:54,292 --> 00:05:55,560
IT'S MORE ABOUT FEELING IT.

142
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:56,861
YOU'VE--YOU'VE GOTTA BE GIVING

143
