I STILL DON'T QUITE GET IT.

146
00:06:03,334 --> 00:06:05,303
IT'S ABOUT KNOWING
WHAT YOUR BEST ANGLES ARE.

147
00:06:05,303 --> 00:06:07,005
HOW TO TURN IT AROUND
IS UP TO YOU.

148
00:06:07,005 --> 00:06:09,207
I THINK BROOKE LOOKED MESSY.

149
00:06:09,207 --> 00:06:12,110
COME ON, THIS IS
"AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL"!

