184
00:07:08,666 --> 00:07:09,801
OUT LOUD!

185
00:07:09,801 --> 00:07:11,169
I KNEW JANICE
WAS GONNA GET HER.

186
00:07:11,169 --> 00:07:13,104
I STOPPED LOOKING
