187
00:07:13,104 --> 00:07:14,772
IT WAS PAINFUL FOR ME TO WATCH.

188
00:07:14,772 --> 00:07:16,074
EVEN IF YOU DON'T--
YOU THINK YOU'RE MAKING

189
00:07:16,074 --> 00:07:18,376
