592
00:21:05,569 --> 00:21:06,770
- OH, THANKS.
- (laughs)

593
00:21:06,770 --> 00:21:09,206
I'M HERE TO HELP YOU
AND MAKE YOU BEAUTIFUL.

594
00:21:09,206 --> 00:21:11,475
THIS IS NOT GONNA BE
SIMPLE PHOTOGRAPHY.

595
00:21:11,475 --> 00:21:13,877
IT'S ABOUT DOING THINGS
THAT LOOK EDGY.

596
00:21:13,877 --> 00:21:15,079
ALL RIGHT.

597
00:21:15,079 --> 00:21:18,983
♪♪♪

598
00:21:18,983 --> 00:21:21,885
I DON'T MIND TO ACTUALLY
CREATE A SORT OF...

599
00:21:21,885 --> 00:21:24,455
- BEAUTIFUL BANGS, YOU KNOW.
- YES, MESS IT UP.

600
00:21:24,455 --> 00:21:25,756
CAN YOU GUYS COME OVER HERE
FOR A SECOND?

601
00:21:25,756 --> 00:21:27,024
I THOUGHT I'D GIVE YOU SOMETHING

602
00:21:27,024 --> 00:21:29,126
TO BRING IN A LITTLE MORE LIFE
