610
00:21:47,511 --> 00:21:49,179
WHEN THEY BRING OUT
THE MALE MODELS,

611
00:21:49,179 --> 00:21:51,582
THEY ARE ALL CUTE,
I WANT TO HAVE FUN.

612
00:21:51,582 --> 00:21:53,250
(chuckling) YEAH!

613
00:21:53,250 --> 00:21:55,519
I'VE BEEN COOPED UP
