638
00:22:33,157 --> 00:22:34,725
SO WE'LL MAKE IT HOT.

639
00:22:34,725 --> 00:22:35,759
TODAY I AM

640
00:22:35,759 --> 00:22:39,530
A HUMAN RIGHTS ATTORNEY/
