644
00:22:47,304 --> 00:22:48,439
LOOKS GOOD.

645
00:22:48,439 --> 00:22:49,540
I THINK MY PHOTOGRAPHS
ARE GONNA COME OUT

646
00:22:49,540 --> 00:22:52,009
REALLY, REALLY GOOD.

647
00:22:52,009 --> 00:22:54,812
I HAVE HAIR,
