655
00:23:08,425 --> 00:23:09,927
SO I'M EXCITED, DEFINITELY.

656
00:23:09,927 --> 00:23:15,532
♪♪♪

657
00:23:15,532 --> 00:23:18,168
READ HIM A STORY.

658
00:23:18,168 --> 00:23:20,938
THAT WAS SO KINDA TWISTED
