686
00:24:18,061 --> 00:24:19,930
I GET DISTRACTED SO EASILY.

687
00:24:19,930 --> 00:24:22,132
I LOSE MY FOCUS AND THEN...

688
00:24:22,132 --> 00:24:25,536
THAT'S WHEN EVERYTHING
JUST STARTS GOING BAD.

689
00:24:25,536 --> 00:24:26,970
OKAY, HOLD ON, HOLD OUT.

690
00:24:26,970 --> 00:24:29,706
I DEFINITELY THINK
THAT WHAT HAS BEEN HAPPENING

691
00:24:29,706 --> 00:24:32,476
BETWEEN JADE AND GINA
IS WORKING OUT

692
00:24:32,476 --> 00:24:33,677
TO JADE'S ADVANTAGE.

693
00:24:33,677 --> 00:24:35,078
YOU KNOW, LOOK AT GINA NOW.

694
00:24:35,078 --> 00:24:38,015
IT'S MORE LIKE POSING
THAN MEASURING HIM, YOU KNOW?

695
00:24:38,015 --> 00:24:40,484
