BUT HE IS STEALING THE SHOT

701
00:24:54,731 --> 00:24:56,400
FROM YOU IN EVERY FRAME,
AND IF I HONESTLY HAD

702
00:24:56,400 --> 00:24:57,467
TO PUBLISH THIS PICTURE,

703
00:24:57,467 --> 00:24:59,002
I WOULD CROP YOU
RIGHT OUT OF IT.

704
00:24:59,002 --> 00:25:02,839
THE FRUSTRATING THING IS,
I KNOW THAT I CAN DO BETTER.

705
00:25:02,839 --> 00:25:04,708
BUT FOR SOME REASON,
I'M JUST GETTING LOST

706
00:25:04,708 --> 00:25:06,143
IN WHAT'S GOING ON IN THE HOUSE,

707
00:25:06,143 --> 00:25:09,379
WHICH IS REALLY
OF NO IMPORTANCE TO ANYTHING.

708
00:25:12,182 --> 00:25:13,884
OH, BEAUTIFUL.

709
00:25:13,884 --> 00:25:14,985
MY THEME

710
00:25:14,985 --> 00:25:18,255
WAS PRIVATE INVESTIGATOR/
DOMINATRIX.

711
00:25:18,255 --> 00:25:20,090
I'M NOT SURE HOW ONE
HAS TO DO WITH THE OTHER.

712
00:25:20,090 --> 00:25:22,125
BEND OVER,
LET HER SMACK YOUR BUM.

713
00:25:22,125 --> 00:25:23,193
WHAT?

714
00:25:23,193 --> 00:25:24,528
MAYBE THAT WAS A FANTASY.

715
00:25:24,528 --> 00:25:26,964
BEAUTIFUL.

716
00:25:26,964 --> 00:25:28,165
ALL RIGHT, DANIELLE.

717
00:25:28,165 --> 00:25:29,299
I WAS NERVOUS AT FIRST,

718
00:25:29,299 --> 00:25:31,268
BUT THE MINUTE
THAT THE CAMERA STARTED,

719
00:25:31,268 --> 00:25:33,203
YOU KNOW, CLICKING, LIKE,
I WAS JUST MOVING,

720
00:25:33,203 --> 00:25:35,138
AND, YOU KNOW,
WE WERE PRETTY MUCH GOING OFF

721
00:25:35,138 --> 00:25:36,206
EACH OTHER'S VIBES.

722
00:25:36,206 --> 00:25:38,108
WE HAVE SO NAILED THAT SHOT.

723
00:25:38,108 --> 00:25:40,877
IT'S, LIKE, ORGASMIC BACK HERE.

724
00:25:40,877 --> 00:25:42,679
TRULY.

725
00:25:42,679 --> 00:25:43,981
SO WHEN YOU SAID
THIS WAS YOUR FUTURE GOAL,

726
00:25:43,981 --> 00:25:45,349
WERE YOU ENVISIONING THIS?

727
00:25:45,349 --> 00:25:47,651
NOT QUITE EXACTLY LIKE THIS,
BUT IT'LL WORK FOR TODAY.

728
00:25:47,651 --> 00:25:48,986
IT'LL WORK FOR TODAY?

729
00:25:48,986 --> 00:25:51,655
GOOD. READY?

730
00:25:51,655 --> 00:25:52,689
DOES THIS LOOK GOOD?

731
00:25:52,689 --> 00:25:54,391
DOES IT SELL AN OUTFIT?

732
00:25:54,391 --> 00:25:55,525
OKAY.

733
00:25:55,525 --> 00:25:56,760
KEEP THAT SHOULDER BACK.

734
00:25:56,760 --> 00:25:58,362
FLIRT WITH HIM A LITTLE. SMILE.

735
00:25:58,362 --> 00:25:59,696
I KNOW THAT
I HAVE THE POTENTIAL,

736
00:25:59,696 --> 00:26:02,266
AND I JUST FEEL THAT
I LET MY NERVES

737
00:26:02,266 --> 00:26:04,067
GET THE BETTER OF ME
IN THIS COMPETITION.

738
00:26:04,067 --> 00:26:05,235
WELL, I REALLY LOVE BROOKE.

739
00:26:05,235 --> 00:26:06,670
I THINK SHE DOES HAVE
A LOT OF POTENTIAL,

740
00:26:06,670 --> 00:26:09,406
BUT HER CONFIDENCE--SHE NEEDS
TO REALLY WORK ON THAT.

741
00:26:09,406 --> 00:26:10,774
WELL,
THAT LOOKS A LITTLE STRANGE.

742
00:26:10,774 --> 00:26:12,042
BROOKE WAS AWKWARD.

743
00:26:12,042 --> 00:26:14,478
SHE WAS NOT COMFORTABLE
IN THE WARDROBE SHE WAS WEARING.

744
00:26:14,478 --> 00:26:15,579
AND AS A MODEL,
YOU SHOULD BE ABLE

745
00:26:15,579 --> 00:26:18,015
TO MODEL A GARBAGE BAG
AND SELL IT TO ME.

746
00:26:18,015 --> 00:26:19,716
SHE DIDN'T DO THAT.

747
00:26:19,716 --> 00:26:22,653
DON'T BE AFRAID
OF CREATING ENERGY AND CHEMISTRY

748
00:26:22,653 --> 00:26:23,787
ON THE SET.

749
00:26:25,155 --> 00:26:27,190
OH, I LOVE THAT.

750
00:26:27,190 --> 00:26:29,960
FEEL THE AFRICAN BREEZE.

751
00:26:29,960 --> 00:26:32,796
IT HELPS WHEN BOTH MODELS
ARE ATTRACTIVE.

752
00:26:32,796 --> 00:26:35,065
HE WAS ATTRACTIVE,
AND I THINK I'M ATTRACTIVE,

753
00:26:35,065 --> 00:26:38,035
SO I THINK THAT HELPED.

754
00:26:38,035 --> 00:26:39,036
OH, THAT ONE WAS HOT.

755
00:26:39,036 --> 00:26:40,404
DID YOU SEE THAT?

756
00:26:40,404 --> 00:26:43,006
ALL THE TOUCHING AND GROPING
AND ALL THE SENSUALNESS...

757
00:26:43,006 --> 00:26:44,041
WHAT?!

758
00:26:44,041 --> 00:26:45,509
ALL RIGHT, NNENNA.

759
00:26:45,509 --> 00:26:47,277
THE SHOOT
GETS PRETTY INTIMATE.

760
00:26:47,277 --> 00:26:49,846
IT WAS LIKE,
"OH, MY GOD."

761
00:26:49,846 --> 00:26:51,348
LAST FRAME.

762
00:26:54,551 --> 00:26:56,053
WORK, DAMN IT.

763
00:26:56,053 --> 00:26:57,154
GIRL!

764
00:26:57,154 --> 00:26:58,755
WAIT, WAIT, WAIT,
BITCH, WHERE YOU GOING?

765
00:26:58,755 --> 00:27:00,090
(laughter)
- WHERE YOU GOING?

766
00:27:00,090 --> 00:27:02,192
WAS HE RUBBING YOU
THE RIGHT WAY?

767
00:27:02,192 --> 00:27:04,761
HE TOTALLY PITCHED A TENT
WHILE THEY WERE IN AFRICA!

768
00:27:04,761 --> 00:27:06,330
(laughs)

769
00:27:06,330 --> 00:27:09,099
AND NOT ONE THAT YOU CAMP IN,
EITHER.

770
00:27:09,099 --> 00:27:10,934
THAT FINALE AT THE END...

771
00:27:10,934 --> 00:27:12,769
NNENNA, YOU MIGHT WANNA
CALL YOUR BOYFRIEND,

772
00:27:12,769 --> 00:27:14,638
'CAUSE I DON'T THINK
THAT'S GONNA BE GOOD.

773
00:27:14,638 --> 00:27:16,173
I AIN'T MAD AT YA, GIRL.
GO ON.

774
00:27:16,173 --> 00:27:18,342
MAYBE IT GOT OUT OF HAND,
MAYBE IT DIDN'T.

775
00:27:18,342 --> 00:27:20,544
I DON'T KNOW,
BUT I JUST HAD FUN

776
00:27:20,544 --> 00:27:21,678
AT THE PHOTO SHOOT.

777
00:27:21,678 --> 00:27:25,215
♪♪♪

778
00:27:28,618 --> 00:27:30,454
HEY, BABY.

779
00:27:31,922 --> 00:27:33,357
Uh-oh. Nnenna?

780
00:27:43,133 --> 00:27:46,236
I FELT GUILTY, AND THE GIRLS
MADE SUCH A BIG DEAL ABOUT IT.

781
00:27:46,236 --> 00:27:49,039
I WAS LIKE, "OH, MAN,
OKAY, MAYBE I SHOULD TELL JOHN."

782
00:27:49,039 --> 00:27:51,007
OKAY, I LIED,
I LIED.

783
00:27:54,244 --> 00:27:56,813
(phone clicks)
HELLO?

784
00:27:56,813 --> 00:27:57,881
HELLO?

785
00:27:57,881 --> 00:27:59,750
NORMALLY,
I ALWAYS KNOW WHAT TO DO,

786
00:27:59,750 --> 00:28:03,487
BUT THIS RELATIONSHIP THING
IS NOT--I HATE RELATIONSHIPS.

787
00:28:03,487 --> 00:28:05,122
HELLO?

788
00:28:05,122 --> 00:28:07,090
♪♪♪

789
00:28:07,090 --> 00:28:08,892
