792
00:28:16,633 --> 00:28:18,301
"TOMORROW
YOU WILL MEET WITH THE JUDGES.

793
00:28:18,301 --> 00:28:21,405
ONLY NINE WILL CONTINUE ON
IN THE HOPES OF BECOMING

794
00:28:21,405 --> 00:28:23,473
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL."

795
00:28:23,473 --> 00:28:24,808
YEAH, THIS IS A SHOCK.

796
00:28:24,808 --> 00:28:28,178
UNFORTUNATELY,
SOMEBODY IS GOING HOME.

797
00:28:28,178 --> 00:28:30,414
FOR REAL,
TO TELL YOU THE TRUTH,

798
00:28:30,414 --> 00:28:32,115
12 PEOPLE GOTTA GET ELIMINATED.

799
00:28:32,115 --> 00:28:33,116
YOU KNOW WHAT I'M SAYING?

800
00:28:33,116 --> 00:28:34,851
AND I DON'T WANT IT TO BE ME.

801
00:28:34,851 --> 00:28:36,887
EVERYBODY IS THINKING
GINA'S GONNA GO HOME.

802
00:28:36,887 --> 00:28:38,155
I DON'T THINK
SHE'S GOING ANYWHERE.

803
00:28:38,155 --> 00:28:40,991
THE GAME HAS JUST BEGUN.

804
00:28:40,991 --> 00:28:43,794
I'M TELLING YOU,
THE LAST MAN STANDING IS STRONG.

805
00:28:43,794 --> 00:28:44,928
YOU KNOW? (laughs)

806
00:28:44,928 --> 00:28:49,733
♪♪♪

807
00:28:56,907 --> 00:28:58,742
WELCOME BACK
TO THE JUDGING ROOM, LADIES.

808
00:28:58,742 --> 00:29:01,545
YOU'VE HAD AN INTERESTING WEEK
WHERE YOU LEARNED ABOUT

809
00:29:01,545 --> 00:29:03,713
BEING COMMERCIAL VERSUS
BEING EDGY,

810
00:29:03,713 --> 00:29:06,349
AND HOW IT'S IMPORTANT
TO NOT JUST BE GOOD AT ONE

811
00:29:06,349 --> 00:29:07,851
BUT TO BE GOOD AT BOTH.

812
00:29:07,851 --> 00:29:09,019
YOU KNOW ABOUT OUR PRIZES.

813
00:29:09,019 --> 00:29:11,621
THE FIRST IS A CONTRACT
WITH TOP INTERNATIONAL

814
00:29:11,621 --> 00:29:14,458
MODELING MANAGEMENT COMPANY
