820
00:29:29,239 --> 00:29:30,574
NIGEL BARKER...

821
00:29:30,574 --> 00:29:34,945
THE FABULOUS RUNWAY DIVA COACH
MISS J. ALEXANDER....

822
00:29:34,945 --> 00:29:37,848
LEGENDARY FASHION ICON TWIGGY.

823
00:29:37,848 --> 00:29:39,549
- HELLO.
- HI.

824
00:29:39,549 --> 00:29:40,784
AND LAWRENCE ZARIAN.

825
00:29:40,784 --> 00:29:44,754
LAWRENCE HAS BEEN A MALE MODEL
FOR TEN YEARS.

826
00:29:44,754 --> 00:29:49,259
SO TODAY I WANT TO HAVE YOU
RIGHT NOW SELL YOUR CLOTHES

827
00:29:49,259 --> 00:29:51,928
THAT YOU HAVE ON
AS IF YOU WERE IN A CATALOG.

828
00:29:51,928 --> 00:29:54,364
I WANT YOU TO GIVE ME
THREE CATALOG POSES

829
00:29:54,364 --> 00:29:55,632
WITH THIS LOOK.

830
00:29:55,632 --> 00:29:57,667
MOLLIE SUE, YOU'RE FIRST.

831
00:29:57,667 --> 00:30:01,905
♪♪♪

832
00:30:05,041 --> 00:30:06,142
ALL RIGHTY.

833
00:30:06,142 --> 00:30:10,580
♪♪♪

834
00:30:23,159 --> 00:30:25,195
(clears throat)

835
00:30:27,998 --> 00:30:28,999
HA.

836
00:30:28,999 --> 00:30:30,700
(chuckles) SORRY.

837
00:30:30,700 --> 00:30:36,139
♪♪♪

838
00:30:36,139 --> 00:30:37,140
HA HA HA!

839
00:30:37,140 --> 00:30:38,208
ALL RIGHT.

840
00:30:38,208 --> 00:30:39,709
HA HA HA HA!

841
00:30:39,709 --> 00:30:41,311
- (chuckling) OKAY.
- HA HA HA!

842
00:30:41,311 --> 00:30:43,446
HA HA HA!

843
00:30:43,446 --> 00:30:46,016
NOW I NEED YOU
TO DO THREE EDGY POSES

844
00:30:46,016 --> 00:30:48,919
USING THESE ITEMS.

845
00:30:48,919 --> 00:30:49,920
(grunts)

846
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:51,021
(laughs)

847
00:30:51,021 --> 00:30:53,557
- THERE WE GO.
