THANK YOU, DANIELLE.

850
00:31:04,668 --> 00:31:09,105
♪♪♪

851
00:31:12,042 --> 00:31:13,476
SECOND POSE.

852
00:31:13,476 --> 00:31:15,011
DO I HAVE TO DO MORE
