853
00:31:15,011 --> 00:31:17,013
YOU HAVE TWO MORE EDGY POSES.

854
00:31:17,013 --> 00:31:21,718
♪♪♪

855
00:31:21,718 --> 00:31:22,819
(chuckles)

856
00:31:22,819 --> 00:31:25,121
