858
00:31:26,423 --> 00:31:27,824
WAS THAT A POSE?

859
00:31:27,824 --> 00:31:32,462
♪♪♪

860
00:31:32,462 --> 00:31:33,496
(snorts)

861
00:31:33,496 --> 00:31:35,832
(chuckling)

862
00:31:35,832 --> 00:31:37,767
WORK IT OUT,
OKAY, WORK IT OUT.

863
00:31:37,767 --> 00:31:38,835
YEAH.

864
00:31:38,835 --> 00:31:41,905
♪♪♪

865
00:31:41,905 --> 00:31:44,741
ALL RIGHTY,
SO LESLIE IS FIRST.

866
00:31:44,741 --> 00:31:46,876
WHAT I NOTICED WITH YOU
IS THAT YOU DON'T

867
00:31:46,876 --> 00:31:49,079
HIT YOUR POSES STRONG
