868
00:31:49,079 --> 00:31:51,081
THAT YOU'RE POSING,
SO THAT MAKES IT DIFFICULT

869
00:31:51,081 --> 00:31:52,515
FOR A PHOTOGRAPHER
TO CAPTURE IT.

870
00:31:52,515 --> 00:31:53,850
THE REASON WHY
I WANTED ALL THE GIRLS

871
00:31:53,850 --> 00:31:56,419
TO DO THE CATALOG CHALLENGE
IS BECAUSE YOU CAN MAKE

872
00:31:56,419 --> 00:31:58,188
A WHOLE BUNCH OF MONEY
DOING CATALOGS

873
00:31:58,188 --> 00:31:59,856
BECAUSE TIME IS MONEY,
AND THE MORE SHOTS

874
00:31:59,856 --> 00:32:02,993
THAT YOU GET IN THAT DAY,
THE HAPPIER THE CLIENT IS.

875
00:32:02,993 --> 00:32:04,494
TRICKS OF THE TRADE.

876
00:32:04,494 --> 00:32:06,096
SO YOU HAD A PHOTO SHOOT.

877
00:32:06,096 --> 00:32:08,732
I TALKED TO YOU GUYS THIS WEEK,
EVERYBODY, ABOUT FUTURE GOALS.

878
00:32:08,732 --> 00:32:09,899
