879
00:32:09,899 --> 00:32:11,534
CRIMINAL JUSTICE
INVESTIGATOR.

880
00:32:11,534 --> 00:32:13,670
ALL RIGHT,
SO LET'S SEE HOW YOU LOOKED.

881
00:32:13,670 --> 00:32:16,306
THAT IS A PURE FASHION SHOT
FOR ME.

882
00:32:16,306 --> 00:32:17,374
YOUR BUILD BLEW ME AWAY.

883
00:32:17,374 --> 00:32:18,441
EVERYTHING WAS ELEGANT.

884
00:32:18,441 --> 00:32:20,610
UP NEXT IS DANIELLE.

885
00:32:20,610 --> 00:32:22,579
I ACTUALLY THOUGHT
YOU LOOKED THE GREATEST

886
00:32:22,579 --> 00:32:24,047
IN THE FIREMAN'S OUTFIT.

887
00:32:24,047 --> 00:32:25,849
ALL RIGHTY, SO, DANIELLE,
YOU HAD A PHOTO SHOOT

888
00:32:25,849 --> 00:32:28,852
WHERE YOU HAD TO LIVE OUT
ONE OF YOUR DREAMS.

889
00:32:28,852 --> 00:32:30,220
AND WHAT WAS THAT?

890
00:32:30,220 --> 00:32:31,488
- A SINGER.
- CAN YOU SING?

891
00:32:31,488 --> 00:32:33,023
I CAN'T EVEN CARRY A TUNE.

892
00:32:33,023 --> 00:32:34,090
(laughs)

893
00:32:34,090 --> 00:32:35,425
WELL, LET US TELL YOU,
SING SOMETHING.

894
00:32:35,425 --> 00:32:37,360
♪ MI, MI, MI ♪

895
00:32:37,360 --> 00:32:38,361
LET'S GO TO THE PICTURE.

896
00:32:38,361 --> 00:32:39,362
(laughter)

897
00:32:39,362 --> 00:32:41,765
VERY SAVAGE,
JUST VERY INTENSE.

898
00:32:41,765 --> 00:32:43,466
IT'S VERY IMAN-DAVID BOWIE.

899
00:32:43,466 --> 00:32:44,768
SHE'S LIKE,
"DAVID, GIVE ME THAT MIC.

900
00:32:44,768 --> 00:32:45,835
I'M-A TRY THIS."

901
00:32:45,835 --> 00:32:46,936
ALL RIGHT, THANK YOU.

902
00:32:46,936 --> 00:32:50,173
UP NEXT IS MOLLIE SUE.

903
00:32:50,173 --> 00:32:51,908
I THINK YOU DEFINITELY WORK,
MOLLIE SUE,

904
00:32:51,908 --> 00:32:53,843
THE EDGY LOOK BEST OF ALL.

905
00:32:53,843 --> 00:32:55,178
THAT'S REALLY YOUR GENRE.

906
00:32:55,178 --> 00:32:57,113
YOU HAVE A CONFIDENCE,
AND THERE'S A SEXINESS TO YOU

907
00:32:57,113 --> 00:32:59,683
THAT I REALLY,
REALLY, REALLY LIKE.

908
00:32:59,683 --> 00:33:01,151
SO YOU HAD A PHOTO SHOOT
WHERE YOU HAD TO EXPRESS

909
00:33:01,151 --> 00:33:03,119
YOUR FUTURE GOAL AFTER MODELING,
AND THAT IS?

910
00:33:03,119 --> 00:33:04,587
TO BE A MAKEUP ARTIST.

911
00:33:04,587 --> 00:33:06,723
I'LL SAY,
IT'S A VERY MODERN FACE.

912
00:33:06,723 --> 00:33:08,758
YOUR LOOK IS VERY MODERN,
WHICH IS GREAT.

913
00:33:08,758 --> 00:33:10,794
I DON'T FEEL LIKE
YOU PUSH YOURSELF HARD ENOUGH.

914
00:33:10,794 --> 00:33:12,028
I STILL FEEL LIKE
YOU'RE RESTING.

915
00:33:12,028 --> 00:33:13,196
NEXT IS BROOKE.

916
00:33:13,196 --> 00:33:15,632
MISS BROOKE,
90% OF THE JOB IS SHOWING UP,

917
00:33:15,632 --> 00:33:16,733
AND YOU JUST WEREN'T THERE.

918
00:33:16,733 --> 00:33:19,536
I KINDA FROZE UP
AND WENT BLANK, AND I KNOW

919
00:33:19,536 --> 00:33:21,438
I SHOULDN'T HAVE DONE THAT,
BUT I DID.

920
00:33:21,438 --> 00:33:24,574
SO YOU HAD A PHOTO SHOOT
WHERE YOU HAD TO EXPRESS

921
00:33:24,574 --> 00:33:26,376
YOUR FUTURE GOAL, WHICH WAS...

922
00:33:26,376 --> 00:33:28,378
ANESTHESIOLOGY AND NURSING.

923
00:33:28,378 --> 00:33:30,547
I'M LOOKING AT YOUR FILM,
THIS PICTURE WAS GOOD

924
00:33:30,547 --> 00:33:32,182
AND MAYBE ONE OR TWO OTHER ONES
WERE GOOD.

925
00:33:32,182 --> 00:33:33,950
BUT DON'T BE AFRAID TO BE UGLY.

926
00:33:33,950 --> 00:33:35,285
DON'T BE AFRAID
TO HUNCH YOUR BACK,

927
00:33:35,285 --> 00:33:36,953
TO DO SO MANY DIFFERENT THINGS.

928
00:33:36,953 --> 00:33:38,221
UP NEXT IS JOANIE.

929
00:33:38,221 --> 00:33:40,757
THE CATALOG PICTURES WERE...

930
00:33:40,757 --> 00:33:42,525
I DON'T KNOW WHAT CATALOG
YOU'VE BEEN LOOKING AT.

931
00:33:42,525 --> 00:33:44,894
I TRIED TO DO ALL THE ONES
