932
00:33:44,894 --> 00:33:46,730
I'M SURE SHE TOLD YOU
NOT TO DO IT THAT WAY.

933
00:33:46,730 --> 00:33:48,264
JANICE IS A REALLY GOOD MODEL.

934
00:33:48,264 --> 00:33:49,632
SO, JOANIE,
YOU HAD A PHOTO SHOOT.

935
00:33:49,632 --> 00:33:51,735
AND... WHAT IS
