00:41:11,040 --> 00:41:15,178
"WHEN DOES POTENTIAL STOP
AND TRUE TALENT START?"

1167
00:41:15,178 --> 00:41:18,014
GINA, YOUR FACE
IS ONE OF THE FAVORITE FACES

1168
00:41:18,014 --> 00:41:19,282
OF THE JUDGES.

1169
00:41:19,282 --> 00:41:22,218
THEY CONSTANTLY TALK ABOUT
YOUR HIGH CHEEKBONES,

1170
00:41:22,218 --> 00:41:23,586
BUT THEY FEEL LIKE
THERE'S SOMETHING

1171
00:41:23,586 --> 00:41:26,289
THAT'S A LITTLE VACUOUS,
THAT DOESN'T CONNECT.

1172
00:41:27,823 --> 00:41:29,759
SO WHO GOES HOME?

1173
00:41:33,596 --> 00:41:36,132
WITH POTENTIAL,
THERE'S POSSIBILITIES, BROOKE.

1174
00:41:38,768 --> 00:41:40,636
- CONGRATULATIONS.
- THANK YOU.

1175
00:41:40,636 --> 00:41:41,871
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

1176
00:41:41,871 --> 00:41:43,272
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1177
00:41:43,272 --> 00:41:44,907
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

1178
00:41:44,907 --> 00:41:46,242
THANK YOU, GINA.

1179
00:41:46,242 --> 00:41:51,347
♪♪♪

1180
00:41:51,347 --> 00:41:52,815
(chuckles)

1181
00:41:56,886 --> 00:41:59,055
MODELING IS
DEFINITELY A LOT HARDER THAN

1182
00:41:59,055 --> 00:42:00,389
A LOT OF PEOPLE MIGHT THINK.

1183
00:42:00,389 --> 00:42:04,193
I'M SAD BECAUSE I KNOW
I COULD'VE DONE SO MUCH BETTER.

1184
00:42:04,193 --> 00:42:06,529
I'VE LEARNED THAT
NOT EVERYONE WILL LIKE ME,

1185
00:42:06,529 --> 00:42:08,264
NO MATTER HOW FRIENDLY I AM.

1186
00:42:08,264 --> 00:42:10,666
THERE'S ALWAYS GOING
TO BE OBSTACLES IN MY LIFE,

1187
00:42:10,666 --> 00:42:14,770
AND IT'S UP TO ME
TO FIGURE LIFE OUT ON MY OWN.

1188
00:42:14,770 --> 00:42:21,244
♪♪♪

1189
00:42:28,451 --> 00:42:30,886
COMING UP
ON "AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL,"

1190
00:42:30,886 --> 00:42:32,989
THE GIRLS HAVE SOME FUN
WITH NICK CANNON UNTIL JADE

1191
00:42:32,989 --> 00:42:34,757
TAKES A JOKE TOO FAR...

1192
00:42:34,757 --> 00:42:37,660
MY SKIN IS FLAWLESS,
AND YOU LOOK REALLY LUMPY.

1193
00:42:37,660 --> 00:42:41,030
STARRING IN A COVER GIRL AD
TURNS OUT TO BE NOT SO EASY...

1194
00:42:41,030 --> 00:42:42,164
MY GOD.

1195
00:42:42,164 --> 00:42:43,666
AND A SHOCKING COLLAPSE...

1196
00:42:43,666 --> 00:42:44,734
- OH, MY GOD!
- ARE YOU OKAY?

1197
00:42:44,734 --> 00:42:46,669
CATCHES EVERYONE
BY SURPRISE.

1198
00:42:46,669 --> 00:42:48,604
OH, MY GOD.

1199
00:42:48,604 --> 00:42:53,909
♪♪♪

